\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O love that wilt not let me go,
\par I rest my weary soul in Thee:
\par I give Thee back the life I owe,
\par That in Thine ocean  depths its flow
\par May richer, fuller be.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O Light that followest all my way,
\par I yield my flickering torch to Thee:
\par My heart restores its borrowed ray,
\par That in Thy sunshine's blaze its day
\par May brighter, fairer be.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O Joy that seekest me through pain,
\par I cannot close my heart to Thee:
\par I trace the rainbow through the rain
\par And feel the promise is not vain,
\par That morn shall tearless be.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O Cross that liftest up my head,
\par I dare not ask to fly from Thee:
\par I lay in dust life's glory dead,
\par And from the ground there blossoms red
\par Life that shall endless be.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

